<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: SOCCER-IRELAND AND ICELAND DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-IRELAND AND ICELAND DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland and Iceland drew 0-0 in a</p>
<p>World Cup European group eight soccer qualifier at Lansdowne</p>
<p>Road on Sunday.</p>
<p>AttendancE: 33,800</p>
<p>Group eight standings (tabulate - played, won, drawn, lost,</p>
<p>goals for, against, points):</p>
<p> Macedonia	    4   2   1   1  15   5   7</p>
<p> Ireland		3   2   1   0   8   0   7</p>
<p> Romania		2   2   0   0   7   0   6</p>
<p> Lithuania	    3   2   0   1   4   4   6</p>
<p> Iceland		4   0   2   2   1   7   2</p>
<p> Liechtenstein	4   0   0   4   2  21   0</p>
<p>Next match: Dec 14 Macedonia v Romania</p>
</text>
